# Raglan UI

## Facades (edit for routing only)

- `screens/styles/input/result/result.tsx` → `RegularResult` | `VNeckResult`
- `screens/styles/raglan/{ribbing,front,back,sleeve}.tsx` → `*O.tsx` | `*V.tsx`

## When fixing a bug

1. Identify `regular` vs `v-neck` from `introState.style`.
2. Open the matching `*O` or `*V` file (or shared step under `result/`).
3. Extract shared UI to `components/` only when both variants need the same change.

## Large screens

`frontV.tsx`, `ribbingV.tsx`, `RegularResult.tsx`, `VNeckResult.tsx` — change the smallest sub-section; avoid full-file rewrites.

## Input screens

Shared: `head`, `neck`, `chest`, `stitch-density`, `row-density`, `fit`. V-neck-only: `ribbing-widthV`, `lineraglanV`, `depthneckV`.
